<title>UK: DePfa Bank sets 200 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa Bank sets 200 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY    14.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*IN YEAR ONE, 4.25 PCT IN YEAR TWO, 4.50 PCT IN YEAR</p>
<p>		 THREE, 5.0 PCT YEAR FOUR AND 6.0 PCT IN YEAR FIVE</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANBRIEF 427</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
